  "format": 1,
  "entries": [
    {
      "key": "TUT_ADDON_INFUSIONBREWING",
      "pages": [
        {
          "id": "infusionbrewing:tut_addon_infusionbrewing/text/1",
          "type": "TEXT",
          "text": {
            "translate": "tc.tutorial.infusionbrewing.tut_addon_infusionbrewing.text.1",
            "with": [
              [
                {
                  "text": "注魔酿造是什么\n",
                  "bold": true
                }
              ]
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "infusionbrewing:tut_addon_infusionbrewing/text/2",
          "type": "TEXT",
          "text": {
            "translate": "tc.tutorial.infusionbrewing.tut_addon_infusionbrewing.text.2",
            "with": [
              [
                {
                  "text": "它让你用"
                },
                {
                  "text": "注魔",
                  "bold": true
                },
                {
                  "text": "来处理药水：把药水变成液体装进魔法瓶，再通过一次次注魔延长时间、提高等级或变成喷溅型，最后做成"
                },
                {
                  "text": "永久生效的饰品",
                  "bold": true
                },
                {
                  "text": "或法杖核心。\n"
                }
              ]
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "infusionbrewing:tut_addon_infusionbrewing/divider/3",
          "type": "DIVIDER"
        },
        {
          "id": "infusionbrewing:tut_addon_infusionbrewing/text/4",
          "type": "TEXT",
          "text": {
            "translate": "tc.tutorial.infusionbrewing.tut_addon_infusionbrewing.text.4",
            "with": [
              [
                {
                  "text": "从哪里开始\n",
                  "bold": true
                }
              ]
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "infusionbrewing:tut_addon_infusionbrewing/text/5",
          "type": "TEXT",
          "text": {
            "translate": "tc.tutorial.infusionbrewing.tut_addon_infusionbrewing.text.5",
            "with": [
              [
                {
                  "text": "· "
                },
                {
                  "research": "IB_MAGIC_BOTTLE"
                },
                {
                  "text": "：魔法瓶，自动解锁。\n· "
                },
                {
                  "research": "IB_FLUID_POTION"
                },
                {
                  "text": "：药水液体，需要"
                },
                {
                  "research": "INFUSION"
                },
                {
                  "text": "。\n· "
                },
                {
                  "research": "IB_DURATION"
                },
                {
                  "text": "、"
                },
                {
                  "research": "IB_AMPLIFIER"
                },
                {
                  "text": "：延长时效、提升药效。\n· "
                },
                {
                  "research": "IB_POTION_AMULET"
                },
                {
                  "text": "：药水护身符，佩戴在饰品栏中持续获得药水效果。\n· "
                },
                {
                  "research": "IB_POTION_FOCUS"
                },
                {
                  "text": "：药水法杖核心。\n"
                }
              ]
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "infusionbrewing:tut_addon_infusionbrewing/recommended/divider",
          "type": "DIVIDER"
        },
        {
          "id": "infusionbrewing:tut_addon_infusionbrewing/recommended/title",
